  "post_title": "L'ondera Lluna Llunera (Irene Garcia Molina) il·lustra Els al·lucinants contes d'un ruc",
  "post_date": "2017-03-02 20:45:38",
  "post_name": "londera-lluna-llunera-irene-garcia-molina-il%c2%b7lustra-els-al%c2%b7lucinants-contes-dun-ruc",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>(40 fotos) El centre cultural La Bom&egrave;mia, al carrer de Ciscar, 14 a Castell&oacute;, ha acollit la presentaci&oacute; del llibre Els al&middot;lucinants contes d&#39;un ruc, amb il&middot;lustracions de l&#39;ondera Irene Garcia Molina i editat per Unaria Ediciones, que dirigeix Amelia D&iacute;az Benlliure.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/03/P1480855.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>Armand Company, de Catarroja, i la seua filla Sasha Company-Tarasova, de 9 anys, van escriure aquest recull de contes de tem&agrave;tica diversa dirigit a la xicalla entre 7 i 14 anys. Conta les ventures i desventures del ruc Rob&iacute;, de Catalunya, pels territoris de les Illes Balearss, el Pa&iacute;s Valenci&agrave;, la Catalunya Nord i l&#39;Alguer. Segons el territori on trasncorre la historieta utilitza la variant dialectal corresponent.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/03/P1480868.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>Van llegir fragments de l&#39;obra Nadal Escrig Gonz&aacute;lez, director en eltriangulo.es Espad&agrave;-Millars-Onda, i</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/03/P1480875.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>Manu Vives, director i impulsor de La Boh&egrave;mia, un centre cultural on se celebren gran varietat d&#39;actes i que acull artistes de totes les disciplines, que solen interactuar.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/irenegarciamolinapresentaelscontesalucinantsdunruc/p1480820.jpg\" alt=\"p1480820\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/irenegarciamolinapresentaelscontesalucinantsdunruc/p1480825.jpg\" alt=\"p1480825\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/irenegarciamolinapresentaelscontesalucinantsdunruc/p1480828.jpg\" alt=\"p1480828\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/irenegarciamolinapresentaelscontesalucinantsdunruc/p1480829.jpg\" alt=\"p1480829\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/irenegarciamolinapresentaelscontesalucinantsdunruc/p1480831.jpg\" alt=\"p1480831\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/irenegarciamolinapresentaelscontesalucinantsdunruc/p1480837.jpg\" alt=\"p1480837\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/irenegarciamolinapresentaelscontesalucinantsdunruc/p1480840.jpg\" alt=\"p1480840\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/irenegarciamolinapresentaelscontesalucinantsdunruc/p1480841.jpg\" alt=\"p1480841\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/irenegarciamolinapresentaelscontesalucinantsdunruc/p1480843.jpg\" alt=\"p1480843\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/irenegarciamolinapresentaelscontesalucinantsdunruc/p1480847.jpg\" alt=\"p1480847\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/irenegarciamolinapresentaelscontesalucinantsdunruc/p1480850.jpg\" alt=\"p1480850\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/irenegarciamolinapresentaelscontesalucinantsdunruc/p1480855.jpg\" alt=\"p1480855\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/irenegarciamolinapresentaelscontesalucinantsdunruc/p1480860.jpg